# tagwheel-colors — шаги записи (что показывается — tagwheel-colors.md)
# Его слово 2026-10-06: первый GIF про tagWheel — сперва панель без заливки, затем в настройках цвет заливки
# и другие цвета панели, «чтобы пользователь понял суть»; после него во всех GIF tagWheel — с заливкой.
# Цикл 140 (В-296): без своего цвета строка залита цветом темы — первый этап «цвет темы → свой цвет».
title tagWheel colors | Make the open picker stand out from the page
preset visual.tagWheel.scroller.enabled = true
open tagWheel colors.md
caret - #todo || call the bank
stage Theme color
say Default: the open line takes your theme's highlight color
cmd open-tagwheel-left
expect - #todo ==**[#todo]** `Priority`== || call the bank
key Escape

stage Background color
say Background color → your own blue
settings Visual
set Background color = #d0ebff
caret - #todo || call the bank
say The open line stands out
cmd open-tagwheel-left
key Escape

stage Active Field text color
say Active Field text color → red
settings Visual
set Active Field text color = #e03131
caret - #todo || call the bank
say The Field you are on is red
cmd open-tagwheel-left
key ArrowRight
key Escape

stage Inactive Field text color
say Inactive Field text color → gray
settings Visual
set Inactive Field text color = #868e96
caret - #todo || call the bank
say The other Fields fade to gray
cmd open-tagwheel-left
key ArrowRight
key Escape

stage Chosen Value text color
say Chosen Value text color → green
settings Visual
set Chosen Value text color = #2f9e44
caret - #todo || call the bank
say A Field that already has a Value is green
cmd open-tagwheel-left
key ArrowRight
key Escape
expect - book a table / - water the plants / - #todo || call the bank
